VALUES
  ($id$expneg-h-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $2^{-2} \cdot 2^3$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"2","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2}","correct":false},{"latex":"8","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{8}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Suma de exponentes: $-2 + 3 = 1$, por lo que $2^1 = 2$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-h-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\frac{x^2}{x^{-3}}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x^5","correct":true},{"latex":"x^{-1}","correct":false},{"latex":"x^{-5}","correct":false},{"latex":"x^6","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Resta de exponentes: $2 - (-3) = 2 + 3 = 5$, por lo que $x^5$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-h-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Si $2^x = \frac{1}{8}$, ¿cuál es el valor de $x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-3","correct":true},{"latex":"3","correct":false},{"latex":"-8","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{3}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\frac{1}{8} = \frac{1}{2^3} = 2^{-3}$, por lo que $x = -3$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-h-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(2x^2)^{-2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{4x^4}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2x^4}","correct":false},{"latex":"4x^4","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{4}{x^4}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$(2x^2)^{-2} = \frac{1}{(2x^2)^2} = \frac{1}{4x^4}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-h-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\frac{3x^{-2}}{y^{-3}}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{3y^3}{x^2}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{3x^2}{y^3}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{3}{x^2 y^3}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^2}{3y^3}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Los exponentes negativos cambian de lugar: $\frac{3x^{-2}}{y^{-3}} = 3 \cdot \frac{y^3}{x^2} = \frac{3y^3}{x^2}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expfrac-f-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-fraccionario$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $4^{1/2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"2","correct":true},{"latex":"4","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2}","correct":false},{"latex":"16","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$4^{1/2} = \sqrt{4} = 2$. El exponente $1/2$ es la raíz cuadrada.$exp$),
  ($id$expfrac-f-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-fraccionario$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $x^{1/2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\sqrt{x}","correct":true},{"latex":"x","correct":false},{"latex":"x^2","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{x}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$x^{1/2} = \sqrt{x}$. El exponente fraccionario se convierte en radical.$exp$),
  ($id$expfrac-f-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-fraccionario$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $9^{1/2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"3","correct":true},{"latex":"9","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{3}","correct":false},{"latex":"81","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$9^{1/2} = \sqrt{9} = 3$.$exp$),
  ($id$expfrac-f-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-fraccionario$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $8^{1/3}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"2","correct":true},{"latex":"4","correct":false},{"latex":"8","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$8^{1/3} = \sqrt[3]{8} = 2$, porque $2^3 = 8$.$exp$),
  ($id$expfrac-f-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-fraccionario$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $16^{1/2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"4","correct":true},{"latex":"16","correct":false},{"latex":"8","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{4}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$16^{1/2} = \sqrt{16} = 4$.$exp$),
  ($id$expfrac-m-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-fraccionario$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $8^{2/3}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"4","correct":true},{"latex":"2","correct":false},{"latex":"16","correct":false},{"latex":"64","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$8^{2/3} = (\sqrt[3]{8})^2 = 2^2 = 4$. Primero la raíz, luego la potencia.$exp$),
  ($id$expfrac-m-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-fraccionario$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $27^{1/3}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"3","correct":true},{"latex":"9","correct":false},{"latex":"27","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{3}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$27^{1/3} = \sqrt[3]{27} = 3$, porque $3^3 = 27$.$exp$),
  ($id$expfrac-m-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-fraccionario$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $16^{3/4}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"8","correct":true},{"latex":"4","correct":false},{"latex":"12","correct":false},{"latex":"64","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$16^{3/4} = (\sqrt[4]{16})^3 = 2^3 = 8$, porque $2^4 = 16$.$exp$),
  ($id$expfrac-m-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-fraccionario$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $x^{3/2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x\\sqrt{x}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\sqrt{x}","correct":false},{"latex":"x^3","correct":false},{"latex":"x^{2/3}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$x^{3/2} = x^{1 + 1/2} = x \cdot x^{1/2} = x\sqrt{x}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expfrac-m-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-fraccionario$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $32^{1/5}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"2","correct":true},{"latex":"5","correct":false},{"latex":"32","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{5}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$32^{1/5} = \sqrt[5]{32} = 2$, porque $2^5 = 32$.$exp$),
  ($id$expfrac-h-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-fraccionario$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $64^{2/3}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"16","correct":true},{"latex":"8","correct":false},{"latex":"32","correct":false},{"latex":"4","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$64^{2/3} = (\sqrt[3]{64})^2 = 4^2 = 16$, porque $4^3 = 64$.$exp$),
  ($id$expfrac-h-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-fraccionario$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $27^{2/3}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"9","correct":true},{"latex":"3","correct":false},{"latex":"18","correct":false},{"latex":"81","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$27^{2/3} = (\sqrt[3]{27})^2 = 3^2 = 9$.$exp$),
  ($id$expfrac-h-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-fraccionario$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $x^{1/2} \cdot x^{1/2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x","correct":true},{"latex":"\\sqrt{x}","correct":false},{"latex":"x^2","correct":false},{"latex":"x^{1/4}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Suma de exponentes: $\frac{1}{2} + \frac{1}{2} = 1$, por lo que $x^1 = x$.$exp$),
  ($id$expfrac-h-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-fraccionario$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Si $x^{1/2} = 5$, ¿cuál es el valor de $x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"25","correct":true},{"latex":"5","correct":false},{"latex":"10","correct":false},{"latex":"\\sqrt{5}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Si $\sqrt{x} = 5$, entonces $x = 5^2 = 25$.$exp$),
  ($id$expfrac-h-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-fraccionario$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $81^{3/4}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"27","correct":true},{"latex":"9","correct":false},{"latex":"12","correct":false},{"latex":"243","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$81^{3/4} = (\sqrt[4]{81})^3 = 3^3 = 27$, porque $3^4 = 81$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-f-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Si $2^3 = 8$, ¿cuánto vale $\log_2 8$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"3","correct":true},{"latex":"2","correct":false},{"latex":"8","correct":false},{"latex":"4","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_2 8$ pregunta "¿a qué exponente debo elevar 2 para obtener 8?". Como $2^3 = 8$, la respuesta es 3.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-f-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\log_{10} 100$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"2","correct":true},{"latex":"10","correct":false},{"latex":"100","correct":false},{"latex":"5","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Como $10^2 = 100$, entonces $\log_{10} 100 = 2$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-f-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Si $\log_2 16 = x$, ¿cuánto vale $x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"4","correct":true},{"latex":"2","correct":false},{"latex":"8","correct":false},{"latex":"16","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$2^4 = 16$, por lo que $\log_2 16 = 4$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-f-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$La forma exponencial de $\log_3 9 = 2$ es...$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"3^2 = 9","correct":true},{"latex":"2^3 = 9","correct":false},{"latex":"3^9 = 2","correct":false},{"latex":"9^2 = 3","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_3 9 = 2$ significa $3^2 = 9$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-f-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\log_5 5$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1","correct":true},{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"5","correct":false},{"latex":"25","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_5 5 = 1$ porque $5^1 = 5$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-m-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Si $\log_x 49 = 2$, ¿cuánto vale $x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"7","correct":true},{"latex":"49","correct":false},{"latex":"2","correct":false},{"latex":"98","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_x 49 = 2$ significa $x^2 = 49$, por lo que $x = 7$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-m-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\log_3 81$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"4","correct":true},{"latex":"3","correct":false},{"latex":"27","correct":false},{"latex":"9","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$3^4 = 81$, por lo que $\log_3 81 = 4$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-m-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Resuelve: $\log_2 x = 5$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"32","correct":true},{"latex":"10","correct":false},{"latex":"25","correct":false},{"latex":"5","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_2 x = 5$ significa $2^5 = x$, por lo que $x = 32$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-m-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\log_{10} 1000$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"3","correct":true},{"latex":"10","correct":false},{"latex":"100","correct":false},{"latex":"1000","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$10^3 = 1000$, por lo que $\log_{10} 1000 = 3$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-m-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$La forma logarítmica de $5^2 = 25$ es...$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\log_5 25 = 2","correct":true},{"latex":"\\log_2 25 = 5","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_5 2 = 25","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_2 5 = 25","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$5^2 = 25$ equivale a $\log_5 25 = 2$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-h-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Resuelve: $\log_3 x = 4$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"81","correct":true},{"latex":"12","correct":false},{"latex":"64","correct":false},{"latex":"27","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_3 x = 4$ significa $3^4 = x$, por lo que $x = 81$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-h-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Si $\log_x 64 = 3$, ¿cuánto vale $x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"4","correct":true},{"latex":"8","correct":false},{"latex":"2","correct":false},{"latex":"64","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$x^3 = 64$. Como $4^3 = 64$, entonces $x = 4$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-h-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\log_{10} 0.001$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-3","correct":true},{"latex":"3","correct":false},{"latex":"-1","correct":false},{"latex":"0.001","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$0.001 = 10^{-3}$, por lo que $\log_{10} 0.001 = -3$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-h-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Resuelve: $\log_5 x = 0$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1","correct":true},{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"5","correct":false},{"latex":"-1","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_5 x = 0$ significa $5^0 = x = 1$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-h-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\log_4 \frac{1}{16}$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-2","correct":true},{"latex":"2","correct":false},{"latex":"-4","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{4}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\frac{1}{16} = 4^{-2}$, por lo que $\log_4 \frac{1}{16} = -2$.$exp$),
  ($id$logprod-f-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-producto$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\log_a(xy)$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\log_a x + \\log_a y","correct":true},{"latex":"\\log_a x \\cdot \\log_a y","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_a x - \\log_a y","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_a(x + y)","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_a(xy) = \log_a x + \log_a y$. El logaritmo de un producto es la suma de logaritmos.$exp$),
  ($id$logprod-f-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-producto$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Expande: $\log_{10}(3 \cdot 5)$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\log_{10} 3 + \\log_{10} 5","correct":true},{"latex":"\\log_{10} 3 \\cdot \\log_{10} 5","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_{10} 8","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_{10} 3 - \\log_{10} 5","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_{10}(3 \cdot 5) = \log_{10} 3 + \log_{10} 5$.$exp$),
  ($id$logprod-f-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-producto$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Combina: $\log_2 x + \log_2 y$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\log_2(xy)","correct":true},{"latex":"\\log_2(x + y)","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_2 x \\cdot \\log_2 y","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_2(x/y)","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$La suma de logaritmos de la misma base es el logaritmo del producto: $\log_2(xy)$.$exp$),
  ($id$logprod-f-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-producto$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$¿Cuánto vale $\log_{10} 2 + \log_{10} 5$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1","correct":true},{"latex":"10","correct":false},{"latex":"7","correct":false},{"latex":"25","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_{10} 2 + \log_{10} 5 = \log_{10}(2 \cdot 5) = \log_{10} 10 = 1$.$exp$),
  ($id$logprod-f-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-producto$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Expande: $\log_3(9x)$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\log_3 9 + \\log_3 x","correct":true},{"latex":"\\log_3 9 \\cdot \\log_3 x","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_3(9 + x)","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_3 9 - \\log_3 x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_3(9x) = \log_3 9 + \log_3 x$.$exp$),
  ($id$logprod-m-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-producto$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Combina: $\log 3 + \log 4$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\log 12","correct":true},{"latex":"\\log 7","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log 34","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log(3/4)","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log 3 + \log 4 = \log(3 \cdot 4) = \log 12$.$exp$),
  ($id$logprod-m-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-producto$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Expande: $\log_5(125 \cdot 5)$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\log_5 125 + \\log_5 5","correct":true},{"latex":"\\log_5 125 \\cdot \\log_5 5","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_5 130","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_5 125 - \\log_5 5","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_5(125 \cdot 5) = \log_5 125 + \log_5 5$.$exp$),
  ($id$logprod-m-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-producto$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\log_2(xy) - \log_2 y$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\log_2 x","correct":true},{"latex":"\\log_2(xy)","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_2(xy^2)","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_2(x + y)","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_2(xy) - \log_2 y = \log_2\left(\frac{xy}{y}\right) = \log_2 x$.$exp$),
  ($id$logprod-m-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-producto$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$¿Cuánto vale $\log_6 2 + \log_6 3$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1","correct":true},{"latex":"6","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_6 5","correct":false},{"latex":"5","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_6 2 + \log_6 3 = \log_6(2 \cdot 3) = \log_6 6 = 1$.$exp$),
  ($id$logprod-m-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-producto$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Combina: $\log a + \log b + \log c$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\log(abc)","correct":true},{"latex":"\\log(a + b + c)","correct":false},{"latex":"3 \\log a","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log(a/bc)","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log a + \log b + \log c = \log(abc)$.$exp$),
  ($id$logprod-h-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Si $\log 2 = 0.301$, ¿cuánto vale $\log 20$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1.301","correct":true},{"latex":"0.602","correct":false},{"latex":"2.301","correct":false},{"latex":"3.01","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log 20 = \log(2 \cdot 10) = \log 2 + \log 10 = 0.301 + 1 = 1.301$.$exp$),
  ($id$logprod-h-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Si $\log 2 = a$ y $\log 3 = b$, ¿cuánto vale $\log 6$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"a + b","correct":true},{"latex":"a \\cdot b","correct":false},{"latex":"a - b","correct":false},{"latex":"2a + 3b","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log 6 = \log(2 \cdot 3) = \log 2 + \log 3 = a + b$.$exp$),
  ($id$logprod-h-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\log_2(x^2 y) - \log_2 x$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\log_2(xy)","correct":true},{"latex":"\\log_2(x^2 y)","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_2 x","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_2(x^2 y^2)","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_2(x^2 y) - \log_2 x = \log_2\left(\frac{x^2 y}{x}\right) = \log_2(xy)$.$exp$),
  ($id$logprod-h-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Si $\log x = 2$ y $\log y = 3$, ¿cuánto vale $\log(xy)$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"5","correct":true},{"latex":"6","correct":false},{"latex":"1","correct":false},{"latex":"9","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log(xy) = \log x + \log y = 2 + 3 = 5$.$exp$),
  ($id$logprod-h-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Combina: $\log_7 3 + \log_7 \frac{1}{3}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"0","correct":true},{"latex":"1","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_7 9","correct":false},{"latex":"-1","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_7 3 + \log_7 \frac{1}{3} = \log_7\left(3 \cdot \frac{1}{3}\right) = \log_7 1 = 0$.$exp$)
