  ($id$trigrec-m-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-reciprocas$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Si $\sin x = \frac{1}{3}$, ¿cuánto vale $\csc x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"3","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{3}","correct":false},{"latex":"-3","correct":false},{"latex":"1","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\csc x = \frac{1}{\sin x} = \frac{1}{1/3} = 3$.$exp$),
