  ($id$trigrec-m-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-reciprocas$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\csc x \cdot \sin x$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1","correct":true},{"latex":"\\csc^2 x","correct":false},{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"\\sin^2 x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\csc x \cdot \sin x = \frac{1}{\sin x} \cdot \sin x = 1$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigrec-m-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-reciprocas$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\tan x \cdot \cot x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1","correct":true},{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"\\tan^2 x","correct":false},{"latex":"\\cot^2 x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\tan x \cdot \cot x = \tan x \cdot \frac{1}{\tan x} = 1$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigrec-m-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-reciprocas$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Si $\sec x = 4$, ¿cuánto vale $\cos x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{4}","correct":true},{"latex":"4","correct":false},{"latex":"-4","correct":false},{"latex":"1","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\cos x = \frac{1}{\sec x} = \frac{1}{4}$.$exp$),
